  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cut all the vegetables into rough chunks."
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the onion and potatoes in a pot with a little oil. Add the remaining vegetables and the vegetable stock and bring to the boil. Add the spices and stir. Keep cooking until the vegetables are tender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the couscous in a bowl, add the oil and seasoning, pour over the hot water and cover with cling film. After about 5 minutes, fluff the couscous with a fork."
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the couscous to a serving plate, top with the vegetables and pour over the cooking liquid."
    }
